Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.804 --> 00:00:07.986
- That tastes exactly like Cap'n
Crunch with Crunch Berries.

00:00:07.986 --> 00:00:08.819
- It does.

00:00:08.819 --> 00:00:09.652
It does.

00:00:09.652 --> 00:00:10.485
(laughing)

00:00:10.485 --> 00:00:11.318
I'm actually kind of surprised.

00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:12.151
- Laser accuracy.

00:00:12.151 --> 00:00:15.385
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:17.201
- Hi, my name's Christian,
I'm a BuzzFeed Producer

00:00:17.201 --> 00:00:18.318
out in New York.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.977
And I used to be a Starbucks barista

00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:22.546
and I know there's a full secret menu

00:00:22.546 --> 00:00:24.168
of frappuccinos that taste a lot

00:00:24.168 --> 00:00:26.301
like popular breakfast cereals.

00:00:26.301 --> 00:00:30.164
I have three odd frappuccino requests.

00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:31.874
Now these aren't
officially Starbucks drinks

00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:33.563
but they were developed by baristas

00:00:33.563 --> 00:00:37.964
so they could emulate the
exact taste of these cereals.

00:00:37.964 --> 00:00:39.889
So I figured I would have
some of my co-workers

00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:41.452
try some of them.

00:00:41.452 --> 00:00:44.035
(upbeat music)

00:00:47.588 --> 00:00:50.157
- I love how you would like
the colors a little discerning.

00:00:50.157 --> 00:00:51.368
- The color is a little discerning.

00:00:51.368 --> 00:00:54.120
- At least with the unicorn
thing was exciting looking

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.339
and this is so modest.

00:00:55.339 --> 00:00:56.172
- Right, right right.

00:00:56.172 --> 00:00:57.872
It's like a off pink.

00:00:57.872 --> 00:01:00.936
- It looks kind of like
the color of the milk

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:02.678
after you eat the cereal.

00:01:02.678 --> 00:01:06.158
So in that way, I accept
it and I believe in it.

00:01:06.158 --> 00:01:07.291
- Should we try it?

00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:08.728
- Yeah.

00:01:08.728 --> 00:01:09.857
- Alright I'll let you go first.

00:01:09.857 --> 00:01:11.728
- Okay, let's see here.

00:01:11.728 --> 00:01:13.978
(slurping)

00:01:14.903 --> 00:01:15.850
- Oh my God.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:17.729
- That's actually so good.

00:01:17.729 --> 00:01:19.063
- I love it.

00:01:19.063 --> 00:01:20.630
- I guess if someone asked me to describe

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:22.709
what Captain Crunch tastes like,

00:01:22.709 --> 00:01:24.190
I wouldn't be able say it

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:26.879
but I know that this
tastes like Captain Crunch.

00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:27.873
- I mean this one actually

00:01:27.873 --> 00:01:29.954
really tastes like Captain Crunch.

00:01:29.954 --> 00:01:31.209
I'm surprised.

00:01:31.209 --> 00:01:33.362
- My mind is blown.

00:01:33.362 --> 00:01:34.938
- We're setting the bar very high.

00:01:34.938 --> 00:01:36.163
- Very high with this one.

00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:37.494
- This is dead on.

00:01:37.494 --> 00:01:40.077
(upbeat music)

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.346
