all my favorite cereals.

00:01:46.346 --> 00:01:47.636
- Yeah, seriously.

00:01:47.636 --> 00:01:49.134
- I'm not a Lucky Charms person.

00:01:49.134 --> 00:01:51.836
Whatever it is about like the marshmallows

00:01:51.836 --> 00:01:52.899
