00:01:52.899 --> 00:01:53.732
(laughing)

00:01:53.732 --> 00:01:55.297
Like I have chills right now.

00:01:55.297 --> 00:01:59.104
- When I was a kid, I would
literally take the entire bag

00:01:59.104 --> 00:02:01.074
