00:02:01.074 --> 00:02:01.907
- Should we try it?

00:02:01.907 --> 00:02:02.845
I'm super-intrigued.

00:02:02.845 --> 00:02:04.158
- Yeah I think we just have to try it.

00:02:04.158 --> 00:02:05.754
